// NEEDS POWER BI DESKTOP (DAX query view). Not run in the build container.
// The real size of every column in memory: the dictionary of each column, biggest first.
// INFO.STORAGETABLECOLUMNS needs write permission on the model, so run it in the Desktop file, not over a live connection.
EVALUATE
    INFO.STORAGETABLECOLUMNS()
ORDER BY [DICTIONARY_SIZE] DESC
